ains a steady performance. To sum up, this study offers a tenable microservices design, addressing the present limitations in the field of real-time data processing and, at the same time, providing a scalable, secure, and observable architecture of future cloud native apps. © (2025), (Science and Information Organization). All Rights Reserved.},
